{
  "format": "opencadirrigation-catalog",
  "version": 1,
  "id": "en12201",
  "brand": "Generic (EN)",
  "name": "PE 100 pipes by EN 12201",
  "description": "PE 100 pressure pipes of EN 12201-2 / ISO 4427-2, SDR 26 / 21 / 17 / 13.6 / 11 (PN 6 / 8 / 10 / 12.5 / 16 at 20 °C), dn 20 to 315 mm: nominal walls of its Table 2 (MRS 10 MPa, design coefficient 1.25); installed reference prices in EUR",
  "source": "https://www.cencenelec.eu",
  "license": "CC0-1.0",
  "updated": "2026-11-02",
  "author": "OpenCADIrrigation",
  "currency": "EUR",
  "pricesSource": "Regione Autonoma della Sardegna, Prezzario regionale dell'agricoltura, aggiornamento 2024 (Decreto n. 36 prot. 4817 del 12.12.2024), items F.004 to F.006: PE 100 pipes to UNI EN 12201-2 for irrigation, PN 10 / 16 / 25 (SDR 17 / 11 / 7.4), supplied and laid with their joints and fittings (trench and bedding excluded), EUR per metre without VAT. Published rows used as printed (but F.004.004, 90 × 5.4 mm, printed at the price of the SDR 11 pipe of that size and taken as a misprint); the other sizes and classes from a least-squares fit to the published rows (the SDR 7.4 rows F.006 included): price = 3.83 EUR/m + 7.40 EUR/kg × mass per metre (PE 960 kg/m³).",
  "pricesDate": "2024-12-12",
  "sources": [
    "EN 12201-2 - Plastics piping systems for water supply, and for drains and sewers under pressure - Polyethylene (PE) - Part 2: Pipes",
    "ISO 4427-2 - Plastics piping systems for water supply and for drainage and sewerage under pressure - Polyethylene (PE) - Part 2: Pipes",
    "ISO 4065 - Thermoplastics pipes - Universal wall thickness table",
    "Regione Autonoma della Sardegna, Prezzario regionale dell'agricoltura, aggiornamento 2024 (Decreto n. 36 prot. 4817 del 12.12.2024): https://files.regione.sardegna.it/squidex/api/assets/redazionaleras/bc8424d3-e3a4-402e-a0e2-4755218dde78/allegato-decreto-n-36-prot-4817-del-12.12.2024-prezzario-agricoltura.pdf"
